{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a constantly evolving microscopic world to deliver a vital payload. The inhabitants of the microcosm may be small but they can tear you apart, so you'll have to scavenge what's left of previous expeditions from their remains to bolster your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of unique weapons and augments to create devastating combos while strategically placing thrusters, weights, and fins to fine-tune your movement and outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be helped along the way a massive assortment of perks and upgrades that allow you to adapt to any situation within The Appendix.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395890?t=1760241874","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395890?t=1760241874","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/6c8d8f05e9f1ea9de578308afce5f958bd18c6a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760241874","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/6c8d8f05e9f1ea9de578308afce5f958bd18c6a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760241874","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a constantly evolving microscopic world to deliver a vital payload. The inhabitants of the microcosm may be small but they can tear you apart, so you'll have to scavenge what's left of previous expeditions from their remains to bolster your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of unique weapons and augments to create devastating combos while strategically placing thrusters, weights, and fins to fine-tune your movement and outmaneuver enemi